this harness begins as billing-flap

bring in billing-router, an agent, in support.
The router dispatches billing work and notices when the ledger comes back.
require billing-ledger.
watch billing-ledger.
  when billing-ledger is present
    hand this to billing-ledger.
    call this ledger-result.
  when billing-ledger is absent
    hand this to a human.
    No ledger, escalating to a person.
on change of billing-ledger.
  call this flap.
  The ledger flapped, recording the new epoch.
this harness ends
